        // LTA publishes no GTFS (DataMall has routes/stops with headway bands only), so every
        // option is a community conversion with synthetic timetables. This one
        // (https://github.com/thecrapone/singapore-gtfs-2026, generated 2026-01, Mobility Database
        // mdb-3051) has the current network: all MRT lines incl. full TEL, LRT, and the 2026 bus
        // network; MRT trips are synthetic 3-6 min headways, bus times are distance estimates.
        // No shapes.txt. ~336 MB stored zip, but it is static so it's only downloaded once.
        // Transitland's f-w21z-lta is a frozen 2021 conversion (no TEL stages 2-5) — avoid.
        "https://files.mobilitydatabase.org/mdb-3051/latest.zip",
        "f-ktmb" // KTMB (official data.gov.my); only the Shuttle Tebrau JB Sentral-Woodlands is in bbox
    ],
